.TH man 1 "2026-06-08" "0.18.2" "Profanity XMPP client"

.SH "نام (NAME)"
/priority

.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Set priority for the current account. See the /account command for specific priority settings per presence status.

.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
/priority <priority>

.LP

.SH ARGUMENTS
.PP
\fB<priority>\fR
.RS 4
Number between -128 and 127, default: 0.
.RE
